{"title":"Oak Quiver","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Bowyer Lv 18) · Monster drop: Brigand, Kobold Shaman</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Bowyer at level 18 <span class=\"muted\">(652 XP)</span> from 5× <a href=\"#/item/oak-wood\">Oak Wood</a>, 4× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"kobold-shaman\" title=\"Kobold Shaman - dropped it in 1 of 7 looted corpses (1/7)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/7592826f5d8abab1e376.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Kobold Shaman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"brigand\" title=\"Brigand - dropped it in 1 of 10 looted corpses (1/10)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fdd8c032b5f277aef224.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Brigand</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/10<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"oak-quiver\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/bowyer\">Bowyer</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/pine-quiver\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/afd0077237ca16d34eea.svg\" alt=\"\">Pine Quiver</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/black-walnut-quiver\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/084efde70fcbb83e4f46.svg\" alt=\"\">Black Wa